DLLs for the MinGW cfg66 library
Chris Ahlstrom
2026-05-30 to 2026-05-30

To run the tests, copy these files to build/cross/tests/:

  * /usr/lib/gcc/x86_64-w64-mingw32/15-posix/libgcc_s_seh-1.dll
  * /usr/lib/gcc/x86_64-w64-mingw32/15-posix/libstdc++-6.dll
  $ /usr/x86_64-w64-mingw32/lib/libwinpthread-1.dll
    /usr/x86_64-w64-mingw32/bin/libxml2-16.dll
    /usr/x86_64-w64-mingw32/bin/libiconv-2.dll

Notes:

    -   Can replace "15-posix" with "15-win32" if desired.
    *   These are probably needed by every project.
    $   Not needed, it seems, but it is recommended anyway.

Also copy these "66" project files:

    build/cross/libxml66-0.1.dll
    ../cfg66/build/cross/libcfg66-0.4.dll

